{"version":1,"content":"<p>現時在高清的鏡頭下，藝人往往仰賴一雙雙化腐朽為神奇的巧手，曾為徐若瑄與林心如等女神，打造凍齡美貌的御用化妝師沈妙妙（妙妙老師），大談化妝間陪伴天王天后打拚的幕後故事，更分享了不少演藝圈內讓人動容的溫暖人情。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T20:24:19.321081+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T20:01:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T20:17:32.979885+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T20:17:32.979885+00:00","content_hash":"4d964845413005b6dc6618eef515d6fb5b609905505a5d0f295a2c5e23043d66","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}